  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hints: } \\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}-3 \\frac{d y}{d x}+2 y=0 \\\\\n& m^2-3 m+2=0, \\quad y=A e^x+B e^{2 x} \\\\\n& m=1, m=2, y^1=A e^x+2 B e^{2 x} \\\\\n& y=0, A+B=1 \\quad A+2 B=0, A=2, B=-1 \\\\\n& y=2 e^x-e^{2 x} \\\\\n& y=0 \\quad \\text { at } x=\\ell n 2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
